 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"131\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">09.8.24 ~ 9.23</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"211\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">신청일로부터 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">30일이내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※훈련비의 경우 예산이 조기 소진될 경우 신청기간보다 빨리 마감될 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp; ○ 신청절차<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">-&nbsp;접수기간에&nbsp;직업능력개발훈련정보망(http://</span><a href=\"http://www.hrd.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"><strong>www.hrd.go.kr</strong></font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">)에서&nbsp;신청서 작성하여 인력공단 전국</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;지역본부 및 지사에 온라인 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">신청서 작성시 공인인증서 필요, 접수기간 전 신청 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">)</span></p>\n<p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp; <u>*기타 자세한 사항은 붙임자료(근로자 학자금 및 훈련비 대부&nbsp;안내 1부)&nbsp;참조.</u></font> </p>\n<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><strong><font size=\"3\">한국산업인력공단 경북지사장</font></strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
